<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ SCOREBOARD AFTER 2ND DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ SCOREBOARD AFTER 2ND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of play on</p>
<p>day two of the New Zealand-England test match at Eden Park on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Bad light stopped play an hour before the close.</p>
<p>New Zealand:</p>
<p>First innings 390 (B.Pocock 70, S.Fleming 129, C.Cairns 67;</p>
<p>D.Gough four for 91)</p>
<p>England:</p>
<p>First innings</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw Doull			     5</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out			    48</p>
<p> A.Stewart not out			     67</p>
<p>    Extras (lb-2, nb-1)			 3</p>
<p>    Total (for one wicket)		  123</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-18.</p>
<p>To bat: Nasser Hussain, Graham Thorpe, John Crawley, Craig</p>
<p>White, Dominic Cork, Darren Gough, Phil Tufnell, Alan Mullally.</p>
<p>Bowling: D.Morrison 8-2-27-0 (nb-1), S.Doull 12-4-36-1,</p>
<p>C.Cairns 6-0-36-0, N.Astle 4-1-8-0, J.Vaughan 6-1-14-0.</p>
</text>
